{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Beyond</strong> <strong>is a dark, mystical first-person adventure</strong> where you explore dangerous locations, solve organic puzzles, analyze the environment using tools, and choose whether to hide or confront your enemies. Every sound, movement, and action affects the pace and outcome of encounters. The unique noise and physics system turns the investigation into the disappearance of the renowned archaeologist into a tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/a34cc50bc4bbd8a4fb7d456eddbeb34e.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/a34cc50bc4bbd8a4fb7d456eddbeb34e.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/473a05af9756f358e9bc6e7ff37e411a.avif?t=1768360815\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a detective</strong> sent to investigate the disappearance of the famous archaeologist Ashley Mane. This case is your chance to escape routine work and prove you are capable of more. But behind the doors of the mansion, you uncover not just traces of her disappearance, but an ancient secret leading to dangerous corners of the world. <strong>Your task is to survive, explore, and uncover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through exploration and environmental details \u2014 step by step, you piece together the truth, until an ancient secret begins to reshape your understanding of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/354889d60347fc656ca43a23b800de66.avif?t=1768360815\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use object physics to open new paths, distract enemies, and solve environment-driven puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character\u2019s condition \u2014 fatigue, stress, and the consequences of combat \u2014 affects your abilities and forces you to <strong>plan ahead</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/db6e03a2bae4ace3e6ccabd82cdc97d5.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/db6e03a2bae4ace3e6ccabd82cdc97d5.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/3b78a29e0adfccf9fd37613879d22865.avif?t=1768360815\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meaningless codes for the sake of codes. Only logic, observation, and deep integration with the world: ancient mechanisms, symbols, and hidden clues woven into the environment and the story itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/834cafa43beea9e97c7c960f9a176db5.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/834cafa43beea9e97c7c960f9a176db5.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/3c136c3af1cde843f74a2f01dd89b69d.avif?t=1768360815\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noise indicator shows how visible you are. A creaking floorboard or a fallen object may expose you\u2026 or save you, if used wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/737387747d7dad45711f73b32d628eb9.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/737387747d7dad45711f73b32d628eb9.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/54ad17aca1a13fea7f55d11ec3a8b7c7.avif?t=1768360815\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being hunted. Will you hide or fight back? Study enemy behavior or rely on brute force? The choice is yours. You have tools \u2014 and you have weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UV light, a camera, and a flashlight help you reveal what is hidden. Read symbols, uncover clues, avoid traps, and reach the truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/0ca4280b53f415eb333d3fa16ce4d0b8.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/0ca4280b53f415eb333d3fa16ce4d0b8.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/f053e95032d1cd9baf8ec79b62534ec5.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/f053e95032d1cd9baf8ec79b62534ec5.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The mystery is waiting for its detective :)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy dark detective stories with a strong atmosphere, where puzzles are woven into the world and every sound matters \u2014 <strong>Bound Beyond</strong> is waiting for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team is actively adding new puzzles and features\u2014add Bound Beyond to your Steam Wishlist to make sure you don\u2019t miss the news and release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is currently in development. All showcased gameplay, visuals, and features represent a work in progress and are subject to change. Final content may differ from what is shown.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665010?t=1768360815","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/87656c70073f8db506e894bddaa711a612fbfad4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768360815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/3a38afe9913a41f4104b8399546bf9a69401ce88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768360815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/3a38afe9913a41f4104b8399546bf9a69401ce88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768360815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features intense psychological horror elements and a tense, fear-driven atmosphere. It includes:\r\n- Frightening imagery and sustained dread\r\n- Encounters with supernatural entities\r\n- Use of firearms in self-defense\r\n- Themes of death and isolation\r\n\r\nOccasional jump scares and disturbing audio/visual effects\r\n\r\nWhile not graphically violent, the game is intended to unsettle and scare. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Beyond</strong> <strong>is a dark, mystical first-person adventure</strong> where you explore dangerous locations, solve organic puzzles, analyze the environment using tools, and choose whether to hide or confront your enemies. Every sound, movement, and action affects the pace and outcome of encounters. The unique noise and physics system turns the investigation into the disappearance of the renowned archaeologist into a tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/a34cc50bc4bbd8a4fb7d456eddbeb34e.poster.avif?t=1768360815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/a34cc50bc4bbd8a4fb7d456eddbeb34e.webm?t=1768360815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><